NOTICE - third party specification version history
===================================================

This directory holds twenty four consecutive versions of one third party
specification document: src/main/resources/openapi.yaml of the Swagger Petstore,
taken from twenty four consecutive commits that touched that file in
https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-petstore. They are vendored here as the
real version history the T038 diff classification is measured against, per
SPEC 17.1 and SPEC 21. Nothing here ships in any published OPENREF package.

File names order the versions oldest to newest: 001 is the oldest commit of the
window, 024 the newest, and each file name carries the abbreviated commit it was
taken from. `manifest.json` beside them records source, retrieval date, license,
copyright holder and digest for every file, and the license gate checks that the
two agree.

The documents are unmodified. OPENREF claims no copyright in any of them, and
their license is not changed by their presence here.

